> Execute inline with executing-plans. User approved integration validation and explicitly requested a prompt PR to try the optimization. This authorizes a dedicated branch push and PR creation; it does not authorize merging or platform submission. No further optimization iterations.

**Goal:** Deliver a #6-only PR against feat/seekdb-all with honest integrated correctness and fixed-workload performance evidence.
**Architecture:** Pin targetfdb8363f64363819fcf2307be95bcd10a5a7e4ba; reuse clean native experimental checkout with new codex/fts-beng-pr-20261102 branch. First build/seal unmodified integration baseline, then apply exact tested35a04a5 cumulative product+tests patch and build/seal candidate. Keep File SQL and AI code identical. Preserve all failures and old source/binaries/instances.
**Tech Stack:** Existing native Release build, original mysqltest/FTS benchmark/scorer, serial Python harness and GitHub PR tools.
